The liquid_glass.frag shader, the interactive highlight model, the
closed-form damped spring parameters and the drag/press lens coupling
are line-level ports of the corresponding Kyant backdrop library sources
(LiquidGlass.kt, InteractiveHighlight.kt, ColorFilter.kt and the catalog
springs). See README.md for the fidelity notes and known deviations.
